    <string name="maladie_cbsd_cause">Virusi y\'imirongo y\'ikawa, yandurwa n\'inzirabwoba yera n\'ibitsimvyi birwaye.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cbsd_prevention1">Koresha ibitsimvyi bizima, bivanywe ku bimera bitagira ibimenyetso.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cbsd_prevention2">Genzura imirima kenshi, cane cane nyuma y\'imvura za mbere.</string>
